  "caveats": [
    "Moderate rather than Strong: the rule needs at least two cohorts, three treated states and a smallest detectable effect within 5; this design has 1 cohort, 1 treated state and a smallest detectable effect of 4.6.",
    "Confounder scan (not pre-registered; docs/confounder_scan.md): other register changes in the same states and industries: Container deposit scheme (Northern Territory) (2012-01-03, comparison state, medium); Statewide Boxing Day trading (NSW) (2015-11-19, comparison state, medium); Standardised and extended trading hours (Queensland) (2017-08-31, comparison state, medium); Return and Earn container deposit scheme (NSW) (2017-12-01, comparison state, medium); and 1 more. Timing: no treated series moved most away from the reform period.",
    "Re-evaluation: the earlier results were known when this specification was written; the estimator layers were fixed beforehand by the blinded power study."
  ],
